{
	"name": "Create a Prisma Postgres database",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Create a Prisma Postgres database\n\nThis workflow creates a project with its first database and then generates the credentials you need to connect to it.\n\n**How to use it**\n\n1. Add a **Prisma API** credential that holds a workspace service token.\n2. Run the workflow.\n3. Open **Create connection** and copy the host, port, database, user and password into a new **Postgres** credential, with **SSL** set to **Require**.\n\nThe password only appears in **Create connection**, and **Database details** leaves it out so that later nodes do not carry it around.\n\nKeep in mind that every run creates a new project, which you can remove again with **Project > Delete**.",
				"width": 440,
				"height": 560,
				"color": 7
			},
			"id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001001",
			"name": "About",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-500, -280]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
